        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Manchester United F.C., Premier League, FA Cup, EFL Cup, UEFA Champions League, UEFA Super Cup\n- Events: 2017–18 Manchester United F.C. season, 2017–18 Premier League season\n- Topics: English professional football competitions\n\nFacts:\n- The 2017–18 Premier League is the 26th season of the Premier League since the competition was established in 1992.\n- The 2017–18 Premier League season started on 11 August 2017 and was scheduled to finish on 13 May 2018.\n- In the 2017–18 Manchester United F.C. season, Manchester United F.C. was set to participate in the Premier League, FA Cup, EFL Cup as holders, UEFA Champions League, and UEFA Super Cup.",
